{"indicator":"ghg","unit":"公噸 CO₂e","years":[1990,1991,1992,1993,1994,1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024],"notes":{"TWN":"環境部《2026 年中華民國國家溫室氣體排放清冊報告》：2024 年總排放 2.73 億公噸 CO₂ 當量（不含土地利用、土地利用變化及林業），扣除森林等吸收的 2,176 萬公噸後，淨排放 2.51 億公噸。這裡是 2.86 億公噸，多 4.8%：二氧化碳兩邊差不多（Global Carbon Project 2.62 億公噸，清冊 2.62 億公噸），差在 EDGAR 估計的甲烷（1,546 萬公噸，清冊 435 萬公噸）與氧化亞氮（490 萬公噸，清冊 339 萬公噸）。兩邊都用 IPCC AR5 的 GWP-100（化石來源的甲烷 EDGAR 用 30、清冊一律用 28）。","SDN":"含南蘇丹：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上南蘇丹的二氧化碳。","ISR":"含巴勒斯坦：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上巴勒斯坦的二氧化碳。","SRB":"含蒙特內哥羅與科索沃：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上蒙特內哥羅與科索沃的二氧化碳。","CHE":"含列支敦斯登：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上列支敦斯登的二氧化碳。","FRA":"含摩納哥：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上摩納哥的二氧化碳。","ESP":"含安道爾：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上安道爾的二氧化碳。","ITA":"含聖馬利諾與梵蒂岡：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上聖馬利諾與梵蒂岡的二氧化碳。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan's Ministry of Environment, 2026 National Greenhouse Gas Inventory Report: total emissions in 2024 were 273.2 Mt CO₂e excluding land use, land-use change and forestry (LULUCF); after 21.8 Mt of removals by forests and other land, net emissions were 251.4 Mt. The figure here is 286.3 Mt, 4.8% higher: CO₂ is nearly the same (Global Carbon Project 262.3 Mt, inventory 261.5 Mt); the gap is EDGAR's methane (15.5 Mt vs 4.3 Mt) and nitrous oxide (4.9 Mt vs 3.4 Mt). Both use IPCC AR5 GWP-100 (EDGAR uses 30 for fossil methane, the inventory 28 throughout).","SDN":"Includes South Sudan, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of South Sudan.","ISR":"Includes Palestine, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Palestine.","SRB":"Includes Montenegro and Kosovo, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Montenegro and Kosovo.","CHE":"Includes Liechtenstein, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Liechtenstein.","FRA":"Includes Monaco, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Monaco.","ESP":"Includes Andorra, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Andorra.","ITA":"Includes San Marino and Vatican City, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of San Marino and Vatican City."},"hints":{"TWN":"環境部清冊 2024 年：2.73 億公噸，扣除碳匯後 2.51 億公噸"},"hintsEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan's national inventory, 2024: 273.2 Mt; 251.4 Mt net of removals"},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[6,32206,392,-645,205,343,724,888,103,-131,596,776,184,573,1679,1205,1198,1212,1010,681,-520,2058,1451,629,419,336,49,128,807,1011,539,-2003,1999,932,848,717]},"values":{"MYS":[4,7747,1197,790,1430,160,2114,271,1154,-1129,-548,2031,849,242,2475,1826,102,105,539,1813,32,442,334,953,2930,374,-795,297,479,1803,1485,-1709,1051,871,-554,1396],"PAN":[3,6809,548,1137,-278,485,-487,820,1,1461,-299,61,1762,-1117,239,-438,1466,607,-189,-107,1321,1091,1094,-344,809,268,-116,-163,-728,-275,3384,-5778,3739,1765,1363,-470],"ERI":[2,null,null,null,null,41578,1498,4756,3630,-2105,1213,893,-1210,-1682,4095,-969,315,-2221,1983,-129,905,-206,2908,801,315,483,359,615,77,1046,738,680,546,838,428,520],"LKA":[3,14397,-357,1220,111,692,313,503,527,-739,1209,1554,-45,730,236,788,438,-122,157,787,547,935,1464,942,-948,1930,3415,2207,-1535,-863,699,156,299,-2465,1370,1765],"HTI":[3,6899,216,403,-309,-473,797,288,615,48,155,786,-95,410,8,51,232,173,225,135,337,444,354,186,510,68,44,547,182,559,-425,32,227,-582,-239,158],"ARM":[3,12360,-1791,-1857,-3603,117,642,-855,735,